  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "50afcccb0f5b4369c54900930e046c094a59eebfe9130de7e982337de9e67f9c",
      "text": "Sun Wukong’s\nNoisy Nap",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "859cb54ec9a6eb4b9bc06bffa03c746c94636b6567bc9b4b6ee0b1a37a499bbd",
      "text": "Sun Wukong yawned.\n“Time for a nap!”\nHe found a shady peach tree.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "94c4b37f9fceaa2e6a6a7ced73a9935243dfa799a1cb6ce2f9ceed02dc7a4fe4",
      "text": "Pigsy brought a pillow.\n“Soft as a cloud!”\nThen his tummy went\nRUMBLE.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6c27e0171b47827a00303ecba0e71d97d602a29cca40499d17e5421a6fd24c84",
      "text": "“A snack first,” said Wukong.\nMunch, munch.\nPigsy’s tummy was quiet.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f8db94141e8eb06225f7963ebb10a23a6945bc9e81c279b090e944cfe15e407f",
      "text": "Sandy waved a leaf fan.\nA leaf tickled Wukong’s nose.\n“Ah… ah… ACHOO!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5d5ada1dd982877d5ccf556750d55472796303c88b49a3b99e6faaee1a34fdcc",
      "text": "A little bird sang a song.\n“TWEET! TWEET!”\nWukong sat up.\n“A little softer, please!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ed0b54de1fb4950c56c174862410e920c97d494f7c689e11aa58d841b415fb92",
      "text": "Pigsy chewed softly.\nSandy fanned slowly.\nThe bird sang, “Twee…\ntwee…”\nWukong smiled.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "95d6d952662c909ab7c2d3a01b8845d1fc389524044737bee1105de9267378ec",
      "text": "Wukong blew one tiny puff.\nA cloud curled around his\nfeet.\n“Just right,” he whispered.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "52e3beee7ad78b6cc0da0895b71f3a82cfd2e4fe234a84da72451d0a4eb50a9d",
      "text": "Soon, his friends were sleepy\ntoo.\nPigsy snored. “Snrrr…”\nWukong gave one last giggle.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c3beba7e6e938bc381fb2265fc7e88afaeb8c78312548b09fdfee32066dc4585",
      "text": "Under the tree, everyone\nslept.\nThe leaves went hush.\nThe clouds went slowly by.\nEven heroes need a nap.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
